{"author":"schacon+claude-opus@gmail.com","body":"REGRESSION FIXED (mop-up round 1). After round 4 closed at 65/65, a fresh run showed 1/65 again. Root cause: under GIT_TEST_PROTOCOL_VERSION=0 (which this test forces), read_advertisement in grit/src/fetch_transport.rs recorded the v0/v1 peeled-tag advertisement lines (refs/tags/<name>^{}) as real refs, so the fetch wrote bogus refs/tags/<name>^{} refs and spurious 'tag <name>^{}' FETCH_HEAD lines (breaking tests 2-65; they survived the test's for-each-ref|update-ref -d reset since for-each-ref does not list ^{} names). Fix: skip any advertised refname ending in ^{} (commit 2e217796d). Now 65/65. No regressions in t5503/t5510/t5514. Unit tests: only pre-existing gitignore_glob x2 fail."}